Spearhead the unstoppable advance of Democracy with new weapons, armor and much more.
Helldivers 2 Ironclad Democracy Warbond launches Sept 22
Helldivers, the quickest route from tyranny to Liberty is one straight line of righteous operational advancement. And today you have been granted clearance to forge a path clean through anti-Democratic resistance in your own creative way, armed with the brand-new Ironclad Democracy Warbond, deploying into Helldivers 2 next week, Tuesday September 22.&nbsp;
Explosive. Decisive. Definitive. The latest technological advancements in battlefield problem-solving and innovative instruments of Freedom are yours to field test with maximum force and minimum restraint. So, get to your Hellpods and join the trigger-happy YOLO rookies and the cunning, somehow-still-surviving campaign veterans of the Helldiver ranks en route to your nearest hostile hot zone in epic missions of industrial-scale Liberation. Together you can overwhelm the diabolical forces of evil and crush peace-resistant hostiles under the inexorable Tracks of Justice. Get out there, Helldivers, and create a legacy that will endure considerably longer than you do. The Ironclad Democracy Warbond includes:
Helldivers 2 is available on PlayStation Plus Game Catalog. Find out more here .&nbsp;
The Ironclad Democracy Warbond rolls onto the Galactic battlefield September 22.

Features studio-inspired planar magnetic drivers for rich, lifelike sound from PS5 and supported devices
Introducing the next line of PS5 audio products: PlayStation Pulse and Pulse Edge Wireless Headsets
When we introduced Pulse Elite in 2024, our first wireless headset featuring planar magnetic drivers and PlayStation Link connectivity, we saw positive feedback from players who enjoyed the greater precision, clarity, and level of detail it brought to their games and entertainment.
Today, we’re excited to share a first look at our refreshed lineup of PS5 audio products: PlayStation Pulse Wireless Headset and Pulse Edge Wireless Headset.&nbsp;
Superior sound quality remains at the heart of the new headset lineup, with custom studio-inspired planar magnetic drivers that deliver exceptional sound separation and spatial accuracy. This makes it easy for players to pinpoint directional cues, such as footsteps or reloads in competitive first-person shooters. Larger planar drivers have been added to PlayStation Pulse and Pulse Edge headsets, creating fuller, deeper bass, while keeping the clean sounds players have enjoyed from Pulse Elite.&nbsp;
PlayStation Pulse Wireless Headset in White and Midnight Black
PlayStation Link support for the headsets provides lossless, ultra-low latency audio, along with the flexibility to seamlessly switch between devices that support PlayStation Link, including PS5 consoles, PlayStation Portal remote player, PC, and Mac. The headsets can also simultaneously connect to supported Bluetooth devices.&nbsp;
For crisp, in-game chat, both PlayStation Pulse and Pulse Edge headsets feature AI-enhanced noise rejection in their integrated mics to filter out background noises. Both headsets also feature an updated form factor designed for lasting comfort and durability, with rotating earcups that allow the headsets to lay flat for easier portability. PlayStation Pulse and Pulse Edge headsets will be available in White and Midnight Black.
